{"text": "April 29, 1987\nNo. 324 BPA Butane\n\nTO:  E. C. Etzel\n\nFROM: D. W, Shouse :\n\nRE: Project LLM ~ Name Objectives\n\nThe overall objective of Project LIM is to gain younger adult smoker share via\nthe introduction of a low level menthol product. LLM will potentially replace\nNewport as the brand of choice for FUBYAS entering the Coolness Segment and\nYAS non-menthol switchers to the segment by providing refreshing true tol\ntaste without a strong menthol signature. While LIM should deliver a real\nproduct difference versus other menthols, a very relevant and compelling image\nis so important in creating initial awareness and trial among the younger\nadult smoker target audience. To this end, brand name (and packaging) should\nbe the focal point of that image. -\n\nIn anticipation of generating a working name for LLM next week, this outlines\nthe objectives that should be satisfied by any viable LLM name candidate:\n\njoker audienc\n\n18-24 year old\n\n\u00a9 strong appeal among a dual\n\n- fun, active lifestyle\n- live for today outlook\n\n\u00a2 contemporary ae opposed to traditional character,\n\u2018\u00a9 supports LLM's primary product benefit of refreshing tobacco taste,\n@ easy to pronounce/memorable/unique to the category.\n\nLet's discuss prior to Monday's meeting.\n\nD. WY shoube\nDWS27/mmp\nce: \u201cJ. A. Herberger 4\nL. L. Bender g\nJ.D, Weber a\nADTEPBiswelt> ~\n3", "words": [{"text": "April", "x0": 402, "y0": 110, "x1": 439, "y1": 122, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "29,", "x0": 450, "y0": 110, "x1": 470, "y1": 121, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "1987", "x0": 482, "y0": 110, "x1": 510, "y1": 120, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "No.", "x0": 506, "y0": 123, "x1": 550, "y1": 160, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "324", "x0": 564, "y0": 106, "x1": 625, "y1": 149, "conf": 82.0}, {"text": "BPA", "x0": 549, "y0": 105, "x1": 617, "y1": 159, "conf": 45.0}, {"text": "Butane", "x0": 631, "y0": 105, "x1": 725, "y1": 159, "conf": 8.0}, {"text": "TO:", "x0": 97, "y0": 173, "x1": 118